Shopping for clothes in Japan? Say this before you try anything on 👕
Ask first, it's polite.

Today's phrases:
• ためして みても いいですか (tameshite mite mo ii desu ka) = May I try it on?
• おおきい (ookii) = Big
• サイズ (saizu) = Size

